flowchart TD
    start((start)) --> write(Write draft)
    write --> submit(Submit for review)
    submit --> review{Reviewer approves?}
    review -- no --> revise(Revise draft)
    revise --> submit
    review -- yes --> fork[[fork]]
    fork --> notify(Email subscribers)
    fork --> index(Update search index)
    notify --> join[[join]]
    index --> join
    join --> done((end))
